{"instance_id": "openlayers__openlayers-9333", "model_patch": "diff --git a/test/README.md b/test/README.md\nindex 5880c70e3..367610953 100644\n--- a/test/README.md\n+++ b/test/README.md\n@@ -34,23 +34,10 @@ in Chrome by default).\n \n # Rendering tests\n \n-The `test/rendering` directory contains rendering tests which compare a rendered map with a\n-reference image using [pixelmatch](https://github.com/mapbox/pixelmatch).\n+Rendering tests are located in the `rendering/` directory (at the root of the repository) and compare rendered maps with reference images using [pixelmatch](https://github.com/mapbox/pixelmatch).\n \n-To run the tests in the browser, make sure the development server is running\n-(`make serve`) and open the URL\n-[http://localhost:3000/test_rendering/index.html](http://localhost:3000/test_rendering/index.html).\n+To run the rendering tests from the command-line:\n \n-From the command-line the tests can be run with the build target `make test-rendering`.\n+    npm run test-rendering\n \n-## Adding new tests\n-When creating a new test case, a reference image has to be created. By appending `?generate`\n-to the URL, a canvas with the rendered map will be shown on the page when calling\n-`expectResemble`. Then the reference image can simply be created with a right-click\n-and \"Save image as\".\n-\n-It is recommended to only run a single test case when generating the reference image.\n-\n-## Image difference\n-When a test fails, an image showing the difference between the reference image and the\n-rendered map can be displayed by appending `?showdiff` to the URL.\n+For more information about rendering tests, see the documentation in the `rendering/` directory.\ndiff --git a/test/rendering/ol/data/me0.svg b/test/rendering.backup/ol/data/me0.svg\nsimilarity index 100%\nrename from test/rendering/ol/data/me0.svg\nrename to test/rendering.backup/ol/data/me0.svg\ndiff --git a/test/rendering/ol/data/tiles/192x256/5/6/9.png b/test/rendering.backup/ol/data/tiles/192x256/5/6/9.png\nsimilarity index 100%\nrename from test/rendering/ol/data/tiles/192x256/5/6/9.png\nrename to test/rendering.backup/ol/data/tiles/192x256/5/6/9.png\ndiff --git a/test/rendering/ol/data/tiles/192x256/5/7/9.png b/test/rendering.backup/ol/data/tiles/192x256/5/7/9.png\nsimilarity index 100%\nrename from test/rendering/ol/data/tiles/192x256/5/7/9.png\nrename to test/rendering.backup/ol/data/tiles/192x256/5/7/9.png\ndiff --git a/test/rendering/ol/data/tiles/4326/0/0/0.png b/test/rendering.backup/ol/data/tiles/4326/0/0/0.png\nsimilarity index 100%\nrename from test/rendering/ol/data/tiles/4326/0/0/0.png\nrename to test/rendering.backup/ol/data/tiles/4326/0/0/0.png\ndiff --git a/test/rendering/ol/data/tiles/512x256/5/3/12.png b/test/rendering.backup/ol/data/tiles/512x256/5/3/12.png\nsimilarity index 100%\nrename from test/rendering/ol/data/tiles/512x256/5/3/12.png\nrename to test/rendering.backup/ol/data/tiles/512x256/5/3/12.png\ndiff --git a/test/rendering/ol/data/tiles/mvt/14-8938-5680.vector.pbf b/test/rendering.backup/ol/data/tiles/mvt/14-8938-5680.vector.pbf\nsimilarity index 100%\nrename from test/rendering/ol/data/tiles/mvt/14-8938-5680.vector.pbf\nrename to test/rendering.backup/ol/data/tiles/mvt/14-8938-5680.vector.pbf\ndiff --git a/test/rendering/ol/data/tiles/osm-512x256/5/3/12.png b/test/rendering.backup/ol/data/tiles/osm-512x256/5/3/12.png\nsimilarity index 100%\nrename from test/rendering/ol/data/tiles/osm-512x256/5/3/12.png\nrename to test/rendering.backup/ol/data/tiles/osm-512x256/5/3/12.png\ndiff --git a/test/rendering/ol/data/tiles/osm/0/0/0.png b/test/rendering.backup/ol/data/tiles/osm/0/0/0.png\nsimilarity index 100%\nrename from test/rendering/ol/data/tiles/osm/0/0/0.png\nrename to test/rendering.backup/ol/data/tiles/osm/0/0/0.png\ndiff --git a/test/rendering/ol/data/tiles/osm/5/4/12.png b/test/rendering.backup/ol/data/tiles/osm/5/4/12.png\nsimilarity index 100%\nrename from test/rendering/ol/data/tiles/osm/5/4/12.png\nrename to t